{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p id=\"p-rc_37591b4ed87d5eb9-980\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>《2021香港小姐競選》「最上鏡小姐」得主楊培琳，當年參選時芳齡僅 19 歲，是年紀最輕的佳麗之一。如今 5 年過去，楊培琳不僅順利從香港中文大學風險管理學系畢業，更覓得良人，正式升格成為幸福準新娘！</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_37591b4ed87d5eb9-981\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>日前，楊培琳於社交平台曬出與男友的訂婚照，驚喜宣布二人即將邁入人生新階段。訂婚現場特別豎立著寫有「WELCOME TO THE ENGAGEMENT OF Penny &amp; Jay」及「SEPTEMBER 2026」字樣的迎賓鏡子，場面既溫馨又浪漫。楊培琳與未婚夫郎才女貌，她過去亦曾陪伴這位學霸未婚夫飛往劍橋參加晚會，相當恩愛。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_37591b4ed87d5eb9-981\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"8e29c27a-3181-4f6b-a1ed-85625567f388.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20266EOOu8Ru5R1790066956.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"8e29c27a-3181-4f6b-a1ed-85625567f388.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_37591b4ed87d5eb9-982\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>除了未婚夫條件優越外，楊培琳自身的家底亦非常強勁！楊培琳的媽媽過去曾公開家居環境，一家五口居住於市值 4,000 萬、面積達 1,700 呎的豪宅中，生活富足優渥。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_37591b4ed87d5eb9-982\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1b8af60a-5c21-4f7a-8bec-bd906e7862cb.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20265u1DMAubGe1790066956.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1b8af60a-5c21-4f7a-8bec-bd906e7862cb.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p id=\"p-rc_37591b4ed87d5eb9-982\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_37591b4ed87d5eb9-983\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>雖然成長於單親家庭，但楊培琳媽媽對四個子女的教育一向極為上心，豪擲千萬培育孩子。楊培琳與兩個妹妹及弟弟均從小就讀國際學校，其中細妹更曾榮獲「香港十大傑出學生」，一家人都非常出眾！</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-22T09:19:54.353247+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":438,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}